王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-5f3fb0b1d81e1240384b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-1a66aa9734fbf3cb7784","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年，徽使官属挝寿张县吏〖12〗，为有司所奏。诏削县一，户五百。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-7a90ddb548e064ffc624","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-7461d09158a6b26d0eba","layer":"original","quote":"太和六年，改封东平。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":75,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-818fb2083f7e48870faa","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-7461d09158a6b26d0eba","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十二年，封历城侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-9140b2a6a4d37f8473ea","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-7461d09158a6b26d0eba","layer":"original","quote":"三年〖9〗，为庐江王。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-9df5d952da50d913a3d6","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-7461d09158a6b26d0eba","layer":"original","quote":"黄初二年，进爵为公。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-bcc3098999e0350b8e9c","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-1a66aa9734fbf3cb7784","layer":"original","quote":"其年，复所削县。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-87027621c423a4f13bd6","layer":"original","quote":"武皇帝二十五男：卞皇后生文皇帝、任城威王彰、陈思王植、萧怀王熊；刘夫人生丰愍王昂、相殇王铄；环夫人生邓哀王冲、彭城王据、燕王宇；杜夫人生沛穆王林、中山恭王衮；秦夫人生济阳怀王玹、陈留恭王峻；尹夫人生范阳闵王矩；王昭仪生赵王幹；孙姬生临邑殇公子上、楚王彪、刚殇公子勤；李姬生谷城殇公子乘、郿戴公子整、灵殇公子京；周姬生樊安公均；刘姬生广宗殇公子棘；宋姬生东平灵王徽；赵姬生乐陵王茂。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-cdfd40da3cc8e11b599e","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-1a66aa9734fbf3cb7784","layer":"original","quote":"正始三年，薨。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":42,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-f9cbb42707861e45ef03","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-7461d09158a6b26d0eba","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖11〗，改封寿张县。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":190,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xinyang-q-39f37f4204cd825214bc","section":"chapter-025","block":"b-66d36758f08ab16ca65f","layer":"original","quote":"后为历城侯徽文学〖11〗，转为相〖12〗。徽遭太祖丧，不哀，反游猎驰骋；隆以义正谏，甚得辅导之节。","section_title":"辛毗杨阜高堂隆传第二十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0056.xhtml","index":283,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
